// Evidence: /projects/2022B4AA1300P/SchematicGeneration/Papers_dataset/consolidated_paper_dataset_final_locked/agnibha_mixed_pdk_20261008/cases/p06_fig3_output_stage_equivalent
// Original comments below describe the pre-conversion topology:
// original: Manually traced from batch1/images/p06_fig3_output_stage_equivalent.png.
// original: Topology-only golden netlist, 2026-10-01. Not a native Cadence export.
// original: MOS pin order D G S. No independent body leads are drawn.
// original: User confirmed M19 gate is grounded and the two V1 points stay separate.
// original: M19 is represented as NMOS: source at VI, drain at M5 gate.
// original: Undotted VII/VB2 and VII/VI crossings are not electrical junctions.
// original: ReqL = R14 || rds4a; ReqR = R13 || rds3a.
// original: IeqL points to ground and represents Vin1*F - Vin2*G.
// original: IeqR points to ground and represents Vin2*N - Vin1*M.
// original: These two expressions are descriptive only: no behavioural simulation model
// original: or transistor dimensions are supplied by this topology netlist.
